mc-hdd (0.0.4-1) bullseye; urgency=medium

  * uhdd reads the container with od and bash arithmetic, so xxd, bc, seq and
    gawk are not needed anymore.
  * uhdd refuses a disk number the container does not have instead of writing
    past its end.
  * The mc.ext.ini entry escapes the regular expression the way mc expects it.

 -- Yauheni Kundo <e.kundo@gmail.com>  Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0200

